WEBVTT

01:31.640 --> 01:35.960
Are you really willing
to let the flower you nurtured

01:36.480 --> 01:38.080
be taken by someone else?

01:38.160 --> 01:39.640
I'm not willing!

01:41.000 --> 01:42.360
Mother, you don't understand.

01:42.440 --> 01:45.440
That guy is unreliable.

01:46.400 --> 01:47.560
I worry every day

01:47.640 --> 01:49.200
that Yingying will suffer
if she stays with him.

01:49.280 --> 01:51.160
Then take her back.

01:51.680 --> 01:53.320
She was yours to begin with.

02:00.920 --> 02:02.680
She's offended the Niu family now.

02:02.760 --> 02:04.720
Only by marrying her

02:04.800 --> 02:07.160
can you truly protect her.

02:07.720 --> 02:10.080
As long as she faces struggles like yours,

02:10.840 --> 02:13.480
she'll come to understand you,
to relate to you,

02:14.320 --> 02:16.840
and one day,
she'll fall in love with you again.

02:21.880 --> 02:25.160
YU RESIDENCE

02:34.520 --> 02:35.920
Is Ms. Ji not here?

02:36.920 --> 02:39.120
She's inside discussing business.
A big deal!

02:40.360 --> 02:41.200
A big deal?

02:42.440 --> 02:45.320
Mr. Qian from Tubo ordered
30 bolts of Rippling Grain Brocade

02:45.400 --> 02:47.040
for their horse racing festival.

02:47.880 --> 02:49.480
He's paying 30% above market price.

02:50.000 --> 02:52.080
Isn't that a big deal?

02:52.880 --> 02:54.000
If this order goes through,

02:54.080 --> 02:56.160
we'll live worry-free for a year.

03:05.200 --> 03:08.000
Mr. Jiang. See Mr. Qian out.

03:10.960 --> 03:13.520
Ms. Ji, Mr. Yu, please stay.

03:14.200 --> 03:15.240
Take care.

03:15.880 --> 03:16.880
This way, please.

03:24.200 --> 03:26.200
Mr. Bai, what brings you here?

03:26.280 --> 03:27.840
Is there an issue with the profit share
from the first batch

03:27.920 --> 03:28.920
of Rippling Grain Brocade?

03:30.120 --> 03:31.480
The deal isn't over yet,

03:31.560 --> 03:34.240
so why should the relationship end?

03:35.000 --> 03:36.720
Today, I'm here as a guest.

03:37.600 --> 03:40.040
Mr. Bai, as a foreigner,
you might not know

03:40.120 --> 03:43.000
that in our country,
when visiting or doing business,

03:43.080 --> 03:45.280
you must first knock
and present a calling card.

03:45.360 --> 03:47.240
Only with the host's consent
can you enter.

03:51.800 --> 03:52.640
Mr. Yu.

03:56.840 --> 03:58.040
He's already presented one.

04:01.280 --> 04:03.280
Mr. Bai, you adapt
to local customs quickly.

04:05.280 --> 04:07.520
Let's get down to business.
How's it going?

04:08.200 --> 04:10.520
Yingying, did you sign the order?

04:10.600 --> 04:11.880
Isn't this deal going to make us rich?

04:13.320 --> 04:15.680
What do you all think of this order?
Should we sign it?

04:16.399 --> 04:19.040
Sign it, of course. Why not make money?

04:20.560 --> 04:21.560
What do you think, Mr. Bai?

04:24.480 --> 04:27.120
I'm just an outsider
and don't understand brocade weaving.

04:27.200 --> 04:29.400
I wouldn't dare make a decision lightly.

04:29.480 --> 04:33.240
It's still up to you and Mr. Yu to decide.

04:40.400 --> 04:42.640
As for this order,
we've already declined it.

04:44.640 --> 04:47.520
Such a great deal, why not take it?

04:50.600 --> 04:52.360
Mr. Yu, you should've stopped her.

04:52.440 --> 04:55.280
Such a great deal comes with conditions.

04:55.920 --> 04:59.280
Mr. Qian offered such a high price

04:59.880 --> 05:02.440
because the timeline he set was too tight,

05:03.040 --> 05:05.720
too rigid,

05:05.800 --> 05:08.440
and non-negotiable.

05:08.960 --> 05:12.440
Of course,
if we push ourselves, work harder,

05:12.960 --> 05:14.320
it's not impossible to fulfill.

05:15.400 --> 05:16.920
But what if something goes wrong?

05:17.560 --> 05:21.520
If we fail to deliver on time,

05:21.600 --> 05:25.360
we'll be left with a huge penalty to pay.

05:25.440 --> 05:28.080
Right now,
our Bloom Society is growing steadily.

05:28.160 --> 05:29.320
There's no need to take such a risk.

05:34.880 --> 05:36.720
All right.
Let's go with Ms. Ji's decision.

05:36.800 --> 05:38.720
It's just one order.
Earning a little less is no big deal.

05:38.800 --> 05:41.280
Five days from now is a good day.

05:41.360 --> 05:43.720
I'll treat everyone to a big feast
at San Hua Pavilion.

05:44.320 --> 05:46.080
Business is so good now,
and we have so many orders.

05:46.800 --> 05:48.840
- Where will we find the time for that?
- Oh…

05:49.600 --> 05:51.320
Why are you all standing around?
Get to work!

05:51.400 --> 05:52.480
- Let's get to work.
- Mr. Yu,

05:52.560 --> 05:54.600
- this batch of silk is ready.
- Good. Let's go take a look.

05:55.240 --> 05:58.840
Wait… Aren't you all going to ask me
what's special about five days from now?

05:58.920 --> 06:01.040
Did you win a cockfight
or a cricket match?

06:01.120 --> 06:03.680
If your father doesn't scold you,
consider it a blessing.

06:04.200 --> 06:05.040
Hey…

06:06.320 --> 06:07.720
Why are you giving me such a hard time?

06:08.520 --> 06:11.000
What's so special about five days
from now?

06:13.160 --> 06:14.920
Let me tell you, five days from now…

06:16.880 --> 06:18.120
Forget it. I won't tell you.

06:29.760 --> 06:30.880
Um…

06:30.960 --> 06:35.240
Ms. Ji's friends
can't also be friends of mine?

06:35.760 --> 06:36.680
That's beyond me.

06:37.760 --> 06:39.880
It's up to you to win them over.

06:41.880 --> 06:43.040
Miss!

06:43.120 --> 06:44.640
- Gui.
- Miss.

06:46.160 --> 06:49.760
We have guests at home.
Madam asked me to fetch you back.

06:49.840 --> 06:50.720
Okay.

06:51.400 --> 06:53.560
Mr. Bai, I'll take my leave now.

06:54.920 --> 06:57.240
- Who is it? Who came?
- It's your aunt.

06:57.760 --> 06:59.080
My aunt?

07:00.080 --> 07:03.360
The heavens are against me! Gui, let's go.

07:04.800 --> 07:07.560
HUANHUA DYEHOUSE

07:09.800 --> 07:11.040
Where is she?

07:25.560 --> 07:26.560
Auntie!

07:27.880 --> 07:29.520
Auntie, why are you here?

07:29.600 --> 07:31.720
Why are you yelling? Why are you running?

07:31.800 --> 07:33.080
How improper!

07:36.400 --> 07:37.640
Greetings, Auntie.

07:44.120 --> 07:46.600
Now, this is how
a proper young lady should behave.

07:46.680 --> 07:49.560
During your stay here,
teach her proper manners.

07:57.240 --> 07:58.760
Come on. Let's eat.

08:03.400 --> 08:05.080
One must be graceful while eating.

08:05.160 --> 08:06.800
How can you just grab food
with your hands?

08:14.720 --> 08:16.840
Chew your food slowly and thoroughly.

08:17.840 --> 08:21.280
Look at you. Your mouth is stuffed,
and your teeth are showing.

08:36.159 --> 08:38.440
Auntie, how have you been feeling lately?

08:40.600 --> 08:43.159
Have you forgotten the rule of no talking
during meals or sleep?

08:50.640 --> 08:52.960
It was Li Feng who told me

08:53.040 --> 08:54.760
that my brother-in-law's case
has been overturned.

08:55.280 --> 08:57.600
If it weren't
for my daughter's upcoming wedding,

08:57.680 --> 08:59.520
I should've come sooner.

09:00.280 --> 09:01.480
After all these years,

09:01.560 --> 09:03.600
my brother-in-law
has finally cleared his name.

09:04.120 --> 09:06.080
You've waited so long for this day.

09:06.600 --> 09:08.080
I'm truly happy for you.

09:08.160 --> 09:11.040
Yes, I've finally waited for this day.

09:11.840 --> 09:13.160
Come, have some tea.

09:15.680 --> 09:16.800
Why do I find it hard to believe?

09:16.880 --> 09:20.480
When our family faced trouble
and we sought their help,

09:20.560 --> 09:22.680
do you remember how Uncle insulted us?

09:22.760 --> 09:24.280
Uncle may be mean,

09:24.800 --> 09:27.280
but two years ago,
thanks to Auntie's secret help,

09:27.360 --> 09:29.120
we managed to get through it.

09:29.840 --> 09:31.720
I'm grateful to Auntie, of course.

09:32.640 --> 09:33.960
But as for Uncle,

09:35.280 --> 09:38.080
he must see that we've prospered
and now wants to reconnect.

09:38.160 --> 09:39.160
Shh.

09:43.720 --> 09:46.800
Look at your daughter.
She's already settled and married.

09:47.640 --> 09:50.320
Yet in our family,
the two of them haven't made a move.

09:53.320 --> 09:54.280
You know what?

09:55.080 --> 09:56.480
I've actually been preparing for this.

09:57.560 --> 10:00.360
Yaoting, Yingying, come in quickly!

10:11.480 --> 10:12.520
Auntie.

10:14.440 --> 10:17.160
This time, I've brought you gifts.

10:17.240 --> 10:18.400
Come and see if you like them.

10:19.960 --> 10:20.800
This one's for Yaoting.

10:43.400 --> 10:44.240
This one's for Yingying.

10:45.400 --> 10:46.240
Thank you, Auntie.

10:54.400 --> 10:57.160
But Auntie, did you mix up mine
and my brother's gifts?

10:57.240 --> 10:58.560
No, I didn't.

11:00.120 --> 11:03.080
This hairpin is for his future wife.

11:04.000 --> 11:07.160
And this golden sash
is naturally for your future husband.

11:07.920 --> 11:09.280
You two

11:09.360 --> 11:12.200
shouldn't delay your future plans.

11:13.160 --> 11:14.720
Don't make your mother worry.

11:19.000 --> 11:22.320
Yaoting, do you like this jade hairpin?

11:23.520 --> 11:25.680
"Thinking of my gentleman,
gentle as jade."

11:25.760 --> 11:28.040
I certainly like Auntie's gift.

11:28.840 --> 11:30.360
As long as you like it.

11:30.440 --> 11:33.040
Over the next few days,
I will find a few fine matches for you,

11:33.120 --> 11:35.040
so you can take a good look.

11:37.720 --> 11:39.760
Your matters are also on my mind.

11:40.560 --> 11:42.400
But you're not like your brother.

11:42.480 --> 11:46.160
If you want to marry,
you must first properly learn etiquette.

11:48.360 --> 11:49.560
Exactly.

11:53.080 --> 11:53.960
Understood.

11:55.400 --> 11:58.320
YUEBUHUAN INN

12:05.720 --> 12:09.720
Madam, Ji Yaoting needs you for something.
He's asking you to head over.

12:15.880 --> 12:17.520
- Help me handle this.
- Understood.

12:20.360 --> 12:22.480
Yaoting, you need something from me?

12:24.000 --> 12:24.840
Please, take a seat.

12:43.120 --> 12:44.400
These past few days,

12:45.360 --> 12:48.320
my aunt has been arranging a match for me.

12:50.600 --> 12:52.440
That's great news. Congratulations!

12:55.200 --> 12:59.080
She kept asking what kind of woman I like.

13:00.440 --> 13:04.280
In my mind, a certain someone's image
surfaced naturally.

13:06.000 --> 13:07.520
That's when I realized

13:07.600 --> 13:10.000
I could no longer deceive myself.

13:13.320 --> 13:16.280
I always felt she's seen all the sights,

13:17.960 --> 13:20.720
while I'm just an ordinary man.

13:22.120 --> 13:24.160
How could I possibly catch her eye?

13:27.920 --> 13:29.360
But I thought it over for a long time.

13:30.480 --> 13:33.480
All my life, I've played it safe.

13:34.360 --> 13:35.480
This time,

13:36.000 --> 13:37.920
no matter what, I want to try.

13:39.000 --> 13:40.080
No matter the outcome.

14:06.800 --> 14:07.760
Yuniang,

14:08.480 --> 14:11.760
the first time we met
was on May 10th, three years ago.

14:12.560 --> 14:16.080
Yingying had run away from home
and she stayed here with you.

14:17.200 --> 14:18.360
Back then,

14:18.440 --> 14:20.280
you were practicing swordsmanship
in the courtyard.

14:21.320 --> 14:24.360
"Light as a startled flying swan goose
And graceful as a swimming dragon"

14:24.880 --> 14:28.840
It was the first time I saw a woman
so free and unrestrained.

15:10.320 --> 15:11.720
For some reason,

15:12.960 --> 15:14.320
from that moment,

15:15.400 --> 15:17.960
I knew I'd never forget you.

15:20.080 --> 15:21.600
But my family was struggling,

15:22.120 --> 15:24.600
and I couldn't act on my selfish desires.

15:24.680 --> 15:26.080
I didn't even have the confidence

15:27.400 --> 15:30.120
to stand before you
and express my feelings,

15:31.720 --> 15:33.320
until these past few days,

15:34.320 --> 15:37.280
when fate brought us together
several times.

15:38.120 --> 15:40.280
No matter what you think of me,

15:40.800 --> 15:44.760
I want to openly,
clearly confess my feelings to you.

15:47.040 --> 15:51.120
I don't want to approach you sneakily
under the guise of friendship,

15:51.720 --> 15:53.320
nor do I want others to think

15:53.840 --> 15:55.640
I'm too close to you
and tarnish your reputation.

16:00.720 --> 16:01.640
Yuniang,

16:02.920 --> 16:04.360
I admire you deeply.

16:05.640 --> 16:06.960
I want to marry you.

16:30.160 --> 16:31.880
My father ran a merchant caravan.

16:33.040 --> 16:35.560
From a young age, I traveled with him
across lands far and wide.

16:37.320 --> 16:38.800
I'm like a gust of wind.

16:39.400 --> 16:42.520
Neither rivers could stop me,
nor mountains could block my way.

16:45.040 --> 16:49.080
That wind once stopped for someone.

16:52.200 --> 16:55.160
As for what happened afterward,
I'm sure you've heard of it.

16:56.400 --> 16:58.000
I've thought long and hard.

16:58.760 --> 17:01.920
Am I truly incapable
of being a dignified woman?

17:05.680 --> 17:06.800
It's not that I can't.

17:09.119 --> 17:10.440
It's that I don't want to.

17:15.240 --> 17:16.319
I'm a selfish person.

17:18.079 --> 17:21.400
Compared to loving him,
I love myself more.

17:21.920 --> 17:23.760
The baggage I carry is light.

17:23.839 --> 17:27.079
Once it holds freedom,
it can no longer hold him.

17:29.320 --> 17:32.440
But the part of you I love
is your unrestrained self.

17:32.960 --> 17:35.360
I've never wanted you
to change anything for me.

17:36.280 --> 17:37.960
He said these words too.

17:38.800 --> 17:41.240
Do you think Yang Jingshan
is someone who goes back on his word?

17:45.800 --> 17:48.760
But who isn't helpless
when faced with difficult choices?

17:50.800 --> 17:52.120
I don't want to go through

17:53.760 --> 17:55.480
the same thing again.

18:46.240 --> 18:47.400
Shh.

18:47.920 --> 18:50.880
Yaoting, did you forget what Auntie said?

18:50.960 --> 18:52.600
No one in our family,
whether master or servant,

18:52.680 --> 18:54.280
is allowed to stay out past dark.

18:55.360 --> 18:56.680
I did forget.

18:57.960 --> 19:00.680
But it's okay.
I already told them you were asleep.

19:02.080 --> 19:05.040
That's rare indeed, like when
I sneaked out to open the door for you.

19:07.800 --> 19:08.800
Yaoting,

19:09.440 --> 19:10.280
you…

19:28.400 --> 19:29.800
Yu…

19:31.040 --> 19:32.120
turned me down.

19:33.360 --> 19:35.520
She said she's afraid
of repeating the same mistakes.

19:42.640 --> 19:45.880
Yu… appears carefree and unrestrained,

19:46.400 --> 19:48.680
but deep down, she has a soft side.

19:49.720 --> 19:51.480
She once told me,

19:51.560 --> 19:52.760
in the martial world,

19:53.280 --> 19:56.680
the most skilled fighter
doesn't engage in combat.

19:57.520 --> 20:00.800
Because as long as they don't fight,
they won't lose.

20:03.160 --> 20:05.080
She's protecting herself.

20:07.800 --> 20:09.440
It's because I haven't done enough.

20:11.160 --> 20:13.320
I spent a long time
thinking below her window.

20:14.040 --> 20:16.120
All I told her was that I like her,

20:16.720 --> 20:21.000
but what can my feelings
actually give her?

20:22.720 --> 20:24.800
If I can make her like me enough,

20:24.880 --> 20:27.000
make her feel safe enough,
make her trust me enough,

20:28.080 --> 20:30.400
how could she still be afraid
of repeating past mistakes?

20:32.400 --> 20:34.080
So, words aren't enough.

20:35.760 --> 20:36.880
I'll show her with actions.

20:38.920 --> 20:40.080
That's my brother for you.

20:45.160 --> 20:46.440
But Yu

20:47.040 --> 20:48.800
has a strong will.

20:48.880 --> 20:52.240
Once she makes a decision,
it's hard for her to change her mind.

20:53.480 --> 20:56.880
This path might be a long one for you.

20:59.200 --> 21:01.480
I have never been a clever man,

21:02.040 --> 21:05.160
but as long as I'm certain of something,
I'll stick to it.

21:16.400 --> 21:19.960
Why are you calling for me?
No one's paid attention to me all day.

21:21.000 --> 21:22.400
Do you even know what day it is today?

21:22.920 --> 21:25.960
I've been busy! If you all ignore me,
there are plenty of others who won't.

21:27.400 --> 21:29.720
What… What does this mean?

21:29.800 --> 21:32.040
Who said no one cares about you?

21:36.840 --> 21:40.120
This sachet under the lantern
is woven from silk I personally dyed.

21:40.200 --> 21:42.760
My wife and mother made it by hand.

21:42.840 --> 21:47.280
I wish you a lifetime of success,
prosperity, and glory!

21:48.280 --> 21:51.040
I wish you good health, peace, and joy.

21:51.120 --> 21:53.600
May you sail through life smoothly
and make the most of your youth!

21:55.120 --> 21:57.640
May you always win your bets,
except in backgammon!

21:59.480 --> 22:00.720
So, you all knew!

22:00.800 --> 22:03.880
On this fine day, I send my best wishes.

22:03.960 --> 22:06.440
Sang Shisi, happy birthday!

22:06.520 --> 22:09.080
- Happy birthday!
- Happy birthday!

22:11.480 --> 22:13.880
I knew it. You wouldn't forget about me!

22:14.400 --> 22:16.960
I've prepared something too.
Sang An, serve the dishes!

22:17.560 --> 22:19.400
Right away. Serve the dishes!

22:22.040 --> 22:24.840
Everything looks great.
This one's the best!

22:25.600 --> 22:26.680
Let me wear this one first.

22:27.400 --> 22:29.760
Why is Miss Zhu's always the best?

22:29.840 --> 22:32.240
- What?
- Why?

22:32.320 --> 22:34.760
Well… How could anything else
compare to hers?

22:35.880 --> 22:36.720
All right.

22:36.800 --> 22:37.800
- Let's eat!
- Stop teasing him.

22:41.680 --> 22:42.800
Set the dishes on!

22:44.200 --> 22:47.040
- After hanging the lanterns, come and eat!
- Got it!

22:48.760 --> 22:49.800
Ms. Ji,

22:53.080 --> 22:54.120
here's my calling card.

22:54.200 --> 22:55.560
DOOR PETITION

22:58.040 --> 22:59.040
This is the Yu residence.

22:59.120 --> 23:01.200
Shouldn't you see Mr. Yu first?

23:05.960 --> 23:06.840
A few days ago,

23:06.920 --> 23:09.800
Mr. Sang said,
"Five days from now is a good day."

23:10.320 --> 23:14.360
I got curious and came to see for myself.
Sorry to intrude.

23:15.680 --> 23:17.200
A guest is always welcome.
Please, go ahead.

23:18.240 --> 23:19.360
If I'm not mistaken,

23:20.320 --> 23:22.400
all of this must have been your idea.

23:24.320 --> 23:27.400
Ms. Ji, do you put such thought

23:28.520 --> 23:29.680
into all your friends?

23:30.800 --> 23:32.520
That depends on the friend.

23:32.600 --> 23:36.160
I don't mind if my friends are clever
or have their own agendas,

23:36.240 --> 23:39.480
but to be my friend,
there's only one condition,

23:39.560 --> 23:41.480
sincerity.

23:45.680 --> 23:48.440
So, what about us?
Can we be considered friends now?

23:49.960 --> 23:51.400
For now…

24:04.560 --> 24:05.680
we're half-friends.

24:21.640 --> 24:23.840
BAI RESIDENCE

24:25.720 --> 24:28.600
Mr. Zhao, why have you come here today?

24:29.280 --> 24:30.120
The waters of Yizhou run deep.

24:30.880 --> 24:33.480
You don't know their depth,
yet you've stepped right in.

24:34.120 --> 24:35.560
As the Brocade Master of Yizhou,

24:36.080 --> 24:37.280
I feel compelled to warn you.

24:39.400 --> 24:40.680
What do you mean by that?

24:43.760 --> 24:46.240
Abandon your collaboration
with the Bloom Society and the Yu family,

24:46.760 --> 24:49.280
and our Zhao family
is willing to befriend you.

24:50.640 --> 24:51.840
Whatever they offer,

24:52.360 --> 24:55.320
we'll double it.

24:56.200 --> 25:00.600
What do you think I value most?

25:01.520 --> 25:03.680
In business, profit is the obvious answer.

25:03.760 --> 25:06.400
But I've never said

25:06.920 --> 25:08.960
I'm just a businessman.

25:10.680 --> 25:12.000
If you don't value profit,

25:13.160 --> 25:14.680
then what is it you want?

25:14.760 --> 25:16.960
A stake
in your Zhao family's brocade business.

25:23.160 --> 25:25.120
What price would you be willing
to pay for that?

25:44.600 --> 25:45.760
Who exactly are you?

25:46.640 --> 25:48.280
You don't need to know who I am.

25:48.800 --> 25:50.080
All you need to know

25:50.160 --> 25:53.040
is that I can help you win Ji Yingying.

26:08.760 --> 26:12.280
HUANHUA DYEHOUSE

26:14.880 --> 26:16.880
Mr. Chen, move all of this over there.

26:16.960 --> 26:17.800
Got it!

26:26.120 --> 26:29.080
Yingying, is that Mr. Chen?

26:29.720 --> 26:31.160
Auntie, you know him?

26:32.040 --> 26:34.680
He may look strong and sturdy,

26:34.760 --> 26:36.480
but I've heard he has a bad temper.

26:36.560 --> 26:38.880
If he gets upset in the future,

26:39.400 --> 26:40.840
he might even hit you.

26:40.920 --> 26:42.000
That's unacceptable.

26:49.400 --> 26:50.880
- Mr. Sheng,
- Yes.

26:50.960 --> 26:52.200
is everything moved?

26:53.240 --> 26:54.120
It's done.

27:00.560 --> 27:03.800
As for Mr. Sheng,
he looks steady and dependable,

27:03.880 --> 27:07.720
but he's been frail since childhood,
always carrying medicine on his back.

27:08.240 --> 27:10.200
He might have trouble having children
in the future.

27:10.840 --> 27:12.400
Yingying, this won't do either.

27:14.440 --> 27:16.840
Yingying, where should these go?

27:16.920 --> 27:18.720
- Put them inside.
- Got it.

27:20.120 --> 27:21.240
Good day, Auntie.

27:24.520 --> 27:27.080
- Who's this?
- Jiang Liu. He's already married.

27:28.240 --> 27:31.120
Auntie, they're all my friends.
Please don't overthink it.

27:31.840 --> 27:34.960
What do you mean overthink it?
I'm doing this for your own good.

27:35.040 --> 27:36.280
Auntie,

27:37.080 --> 27:38.200
you are my aunt,

27:38.280 --> 27:40.520
and I'll accept any guidance
you give me at home.

27:40.600 --> 27:41.840
But they're my friends,

27:41.920 --> 27:43.760
and you can't talk about them like that
in front of me.

27:43.840 --> 27:46.280
I don't need you
to find me a husband either.

27:46.360 --> 27:47.560
You don't need it?

27:48.520 --> 27:51.000
Could it be you already
have someone in mind?

27:51.600 --> 27:54.240
Which young man is it?
Tell me, and I'll check him out for you.

27:54.320 --> 27:56.040
No, no one.

27:56.560 --> 27:58.520
Do I have no other choice but to marry?

27:58.600 --> 28:00.240
If you don't marry, then what will you do?

28:00.320 --> 28:02.120
If you don't marry,
are you planning to become a nun?

28:02.200 --> 28:04.080
I want to do my own thing.

28:04.160 --> 28:05.840
I want to restore the Ji family's honor.

28:05.920 --> 28:07.920
I want to make a name for myself
as a woman.

28:08.000 --> 28:09.240
I want to clean up the brocade industry.

28:09.320 --> 28:12.240
I don't want to be a woman whose life
revolves around her husband and children,

28:12.320 --> 28:13.920
confined to the inner chambers!

28:19.640 --> 28:22.440
Auntie, I didn't mean it like that. I…

28:22.960 --> 28:25.320
- Auntie…
- All right.

28:26.600 --> 28:29.640
You have grand ambitions.
I'm in your way here.

28:29.720 --> 28:32.160
- No…
- I will pack up and go home now.

28:32.240 --> 28:33.840
- Auntie, no…
- I don't want to trouble you anymore.

28:34.360 --> 28:36.160
Is Mrs. Li here?

28:37.800 --> 28:39.680
Who are you?
Why are you barging into my home?

28:45.200 --> 28:46.400
Mrs. Li,

28:46.480 --> 28:48.880
your husband owes our gambling house
a thousand guan.

28:50.040 --> 28:53.480
He hasn't paid it back for months.
We've already detained him.

28:54.400 --> 28:57.480
If you can't gather the money to pay,
then be prepared to collect his body.

28:58.920 --> 29:00.440
Li Feng has never entered
a gambling house.

29:00.520 --> 29:01.680
How could he owe you money?

29:02.360 --> 29:03.760
LI FENG'S DEBT NOTE

29:06.920 --> 29:08.080
Believe it now?

29:08.160 --> 29:09.200
Your husband has been

29:09.280 --> 29:10.920
to the gambling house countless times
this year.

29:11.000 --> 29:12.840
He's already gambled away
everything you own.

29:12.920 --> 29:14.360
Our boss said,

29:14.440 --> 29:15.640
if you truly can't pay,

29:15.720 --> 29:17.800
then you and your daughter
will pay the debt instead.

29:20.400 --> 29:22.720
Detaining citizens, kidnapping women…

29:22.800 --> 29:23.880
Do you have any regard for the law?

29:24.400 --> 29:26.800
Paying debts is a natural obligation.

29:26.880 --> 29:29.200
Even if you go to the magistrate,
we're not afraid.

29:29.280 --> 29:30.560
Our boss said,

29:30.640 --> 29:33.640
if you pay back the money in three days,
there will be no trouble.

29:33.720 --> 29:35.840
If not, prepare to see what happens

29:35.920 --> 29:37.040
to your husband and daughter!

29:49.800 --> 29:51.880
Three days…

29:53.520 --> 29:54.520
Only three days.

29:54.600 --> 29:57.600
Where am I supposed
to find a thousand guan? Dear…

29:57.680 --> 30:00.120
Don't panic. Let's not panic just yet.

30:01.720 --> 30:04.040
We still have some money at home,

30:04.640 --> 30:06.160
but a thousand guan…

30:06.800 --> 30:08.800
There's no way we can gather that much.

30:09.680 --> 30:12.040
How about we report this
to the authorities

30:12.120 --> 30:13.760
to at least save Li Feng's life?

30:15.080 --> 30:18.120
No! We can't go to the authorities.
Absolutely not!

30:18.840 --> 30:20.880
If word of this disgrace gets out,

30:22.120 --> 30:24.520
it'll ruin
my daughter's marriage prospects.

30:28.480 --> 30:29.520
Yingying,

30:30.160 --> 30:32.000
does Bloom Society still have money
in its accounts?

30:35.200 --> 30:36.120
Yingying,

30:36.640 --> 30:38.600
if there's any money left in the accounts,

30:38.680 --> 30:42.040
please, no matter what,
use it to save your uncle.

30:43.520 --> 30:47.120
No, you'll be saving your aunt.
You'll be saving your cousin.

30:47.640 --> 30:50.320
You and her are like real sisters.
Yingying…

30:50.400 --> 30:52.440
Auntie, don't worry just yet.

30:52.960 --> 30:54.480
When our family faced hardships,

30:54.560 --> 30:56.560
out of all our relatives,
you were the only one who helped us.

30:57.160 --> 31:00.000
Now that you're in trouble,
we won't stand idly by.

31:01.040 --> 31:03.640
But a thousand guan is no small amount.

31:03.720 --> 31:05.600
Let me figure out a way, all right?

31:07.520 --> 31:10.360
All right. I won't push you.

31:11.000 --> 31:12.640
Think of a way for me.

31:14.080 --> 31:16.320
I have no one else to rely on but you.

31:30.200 --> 31:31.360
What's going on?

31:31.440 --> 31:33.240
- Why call all of us here?
- Yingying. What happened?

31:33.760 --> 31:36.560
There's trouble at home, and I need money.

31:37.080 --> 31:40.040
I'm thinking of revisiting
Mr. Qian's order.

31:41.440 --> 31:42.360
I'll go out to investigate

31:42.440 --> 31:44.960
whether Mr. Qian has signed
with someone else.

31:45.040 --> 31:46.480
I'll contact the silk suppliers.

31:46.560 --> 31:49.120
If we can secure the deal with Mr. Qian,
I'll quickly place an order for silk.

31:49.200 --> 31:51.280
The dyes we bought last time
might not be enough.

31:51.360 --> 31:52.600
I'll check with the shopkeepers.

31:53.480 --> 31:55.840
You're not asking me
what happened specifically?

31:55.920 --> 31:57.360
It doesn't matter what it is.

31:57.440 --> 31:58.760
If there's money to make,
we'll make it together.

31:58.840 --> 32:00.640
If there's trouble,
we'll face it together.

32:03.640 --> 32:05.280
I… Hey!

32:06.440 --> 32:08.880
Hey, what can I do?

32:10.120 --> 32:12.920
Actually, there's one thing
only you can handle.

32:14.440 --> 32:15.560
Then it's settled.

32:21.040 --> 32:23.280
I've found out that every June,

32:23.360 --> 32:24.920
there's a grand horse racing festival
in Tubo.

32:25.520 --> 32:28.880
Everyone participates,
from officials and nobles to commoners.

32:28.960 --> 32:30.400
SAN HUA PAVILION

32:30.480 --> 32:31.800
Welcome, honored guests.
Please, come inside.

32:32.320 --> 32:34.320
It seems fine. Nothing to worry about.

32:34.400 --> 32:36.680
Deals that seem too good
always make people uneasy.

32:36.760 --> 32:39.680
Let's investigate a bit later
to see if this Mr. Qian

32:39.760 --> 32:41.440
is truly from Tubo.

32:41.520 --> 32:43.160
- No problem, leave it to me.
- Ms. Ji,

32:43.840 --> 32:46.200
- what a coincidence!
- Mr. Bai, you're here too.

32:47.640 --> 32:48.640
To be honest,

32:48.720 --> 32:51.040
I came here specifically
to wait for you today.

32:52.040 --> 32:53.640
How did you know I'd be here?

32:56.360 --> 32:58.520
May I have a word with you in private?

33:00.240 --> 33:02.000
Shisi, go warm the wine.

33:03.560 --> 33:04.400
All right.

33:05.720 --> 33:07.560
All this secrecy…
I'm not interested in listening anyway!

33:08.960 --> 33:09.800
Move aside.

33:16.560 --> 33:19.000
I heard you're urgently in need
of a sum of money lately.

33:19.800 --> 33:21.720
This deal with Mr. Qian…

33:22.240 --> 33:25.160
Tight deadlines, heavy tasks,
the risks aren't small.

33:26.000 --> 33:27.720
If you trust me,

33:27.800 --> 33:31.560
I could lend you some money
to tide you over.

33:37.760 --> 33:39.400
Thank you for your kind offer, Mr. Bai.

33:39.480 --> 33:40.960
But I think

33:41.040 --> 33:43.480
business calculations are straightforward,
while personal favors are not.

33:43.560 --> 33:46.520
Personal favors often carry risks
greater than business deals.

33:50.040 --> 33:53.240
In the end, you still don't trust me.

33:54.280 --> 33:55.400
But it's fine.

33:55.480 --> 33:58.640
After all, the two of us
are only half-friends.

34:02.200 --> 34:03.760
I have other matters to attend to,
so I'll take my leave.

34:15.120 --> 34:16.719
Mr. Qian, sorry to keep you waiting.

34:17.239 --> 34:18.840
Ms. Ji, please sit.

34:21.000 --> 34:23.679
Last time, you made it clear

34:24.199 --> 34:26.719
that you wouldn't work with me.

34:26.800 --> 34:29.480
So, why have you changed your mind now?

34:30.199 --> 34:31.800
We didn't consider everything
thoroughly before.

34:32.760 --> 34:36.560
Today, we've brought a gift
to apologize to you personally.

34:38.000 --> 34:39.520
This gift

34:39.600 --> 34:42.480
is much simpler than the one
I gave you last time.

34:45.199 --> 34:46.800
But it’s filled with heartfelt sincerity.

34:46.880 --> 34:48.800
To show our sincerity,
let me put it on you personally.

34:48.880 --> 34:49.920
What are you doing?

34:51.000 --> 34:54.239
How dare you touch the head
of a Tubo person so casually!

34:57.720 --> 35:00.480
Apologies. It was disrespectful of us.
Please don't be angry.

35:02.720 --> 35:05.320
Here, this is the finest wine from Yizhou.

35:05.840 --> 35:07.280
Mr. Qian, please try it.

35:29.120 --> 35:30.160
Excellent wine!

35:33.600 --> 35:37.720
Ms. Ji, if you want to work with us,

35:37.800 --> 35:39.760
let's have a proper discussion.

35:40.520 --> 35:41.840
Thank you, Mr. Qian. That's great!

35:43.400 --> 35:44.440
Please.

35:50.080 --> 35:51.040
Thank you for your efforts.

35:55.680 --> 35:58.840
Yingying, we're buying so much raw silk.

35:58.920 --> 36:00.160
Doesn't that leave Bloom Society's account

36:00.240 --> 36:01.280
nearly empty?

36:02.600 --> 36:04.120
For now, there isn't much money left.

36:04.200 --> 36:06.960
But in six months,
once we settle accounts with Mr. Qian,

36:07.040 --> 36:08.240
we'll make a huge profit.

36:08.840 --> 36:09.920
But…

36:10.000 --> 36:12.000
what if we don't complete
the delivery on time?

36:12.640 --> 36:14.240
I still feel uneasy.

36:15.920 --> 36:18.920
For Auntie and my cousin,
there's no other choice.

36:19.000 --> 36:19.840
We'll have to take a gamble.

36:20.800 --> 36:22.720
There really was no other way this time,

36:23.880 --> 36:26.080
but in the future,
we should take fewer risks.

36:26.160 --> 36:27.160
No more all-or-nothing gambles.

36:29.840 --> 36:31.120
Be more cautious.

36:33.920 --> 36:36.840
In the future, don't take risks,

36:37.360 --> 36:40.320
and definitely don't place everything
on the line.

36:41.600 --> 36:42.440
Yingying.

36:44.960 --> 36:48.240
It's nothing. I just thought of an ally.

36:49.520 --> 36:50.360
An ally?

36:54.840 --> 36:56.080
This way.

37:07.000 --> 37:09.360
NANZHAO

37:16.800 --> 37:20.160
Throughout all of Nanzhao,
Prince Bai loves Shu brocade the most.

37:21.560 --> 37:23.200
In his Brocade Vault,

37:23.280 --> 37:25.440
he has collected the most precious silks
and brocades in the world.

37:26.280 --> 37:28.480
But Prince Bai
has been ill for quite some time,

37:29.600 --> 37:31.520
resting and not making public appearances.

37:31.600 --> 37:35.120
Currently, the entire palace
is managed by Ning Dai,

37:35.200 --> 37:36.680
the daughter
of the former Qingping Officer,

37:36.760 --> 37:38.080
Prince Bai's mentor.

37:39.160 --> 37:40.520
Prince Bai has a mortal enemy,

37:41.120 --> 37:42.800
the current Qingping Officer, Du Yan.

37:42.880 --> 37:45.320
Ning Dai fears that Du Yan
will seize the chance to stir up trouble,

37:45.400 --> 37:48.160
so she has secured the palace
as tightly as an iron barrel.

37:48.680 --> 37:49.680
It's not easy to get in.

37:51.440 --> 37:54.600
Not easy doesn't mean impossible.

38:01.120 --> 38:02.320
Someone's trying
to assassinate the Prince!

38:02.400 --> 38:03.640
Protect the Prince!

38:04.920 --> 38:05.760
Hurry!

38:06.480 --> 38:07.320
Quickly!

39:06.560 --> 39:08.080
Rippling Grain Brocade!

39:10.080 --> 39:11.520
Even Yizhou doesn't have many bolts of it.

39:12.680 --> 39:14.120
How does Nanzhao have this?

39:43.080 --> 39:44.240
Shu Red Brocade!

39:48.960 --> 39:51.560
No wonder this Brocade Vault
is off-limits.

39:52.200 --> 39:54.600
Turns out
they're smuggling tribute brocade!

40:27.200 --> 40:28.800
All right…

40:28.880 --> 40:30.640
I can't win against you.
I'm not competing anymore.

40:32.040 --> 40:33.000
But…

40:33.080 --> 40:35.040
if I call out,

40:35.120 --> 40:36.840
the guards outside will hear me.

40:37.360 --> 40:40.080
By then, we'll both perish together.

40:42.400 --> 40:43.680
What do you want?

40:45.600 --> 40:47.040
I'll help you sell this.

40:47.120 --> 40:50.080
As for the money…
we'll split it fifty-fifty.

40:55.560 --> 40:58.080
This piece is mine.
Take whatever else you want.

40:58.160 --> 41:01.760
No way.
Shu Red Brocade is the most valuable.

41:03.880 --> 41:04.920
But…

41:05.600 --> 41:07.960
how did you know
there was Shu Red Brocade here?

41:08.600 --> 41:10.400
I had to dig for a long time
to find this out.

41:12.800 --> 41:14.920
- Do you want to know?
- Of course, I do.

41:15.440 --> 41:17.920
For us thieves, information is everything.

41:20.040 --> 41:20.960
Here's a deal.

41:21.040 --> 41:24.880
Tell me your informant,
and I'll consider working with you.

41:27.920 --> 41:30.600
You've been waiting for me
a long time, Ning Dai.

41:33.840 --> 41:36.080
What are you talking about?
I don't understand.

41:37.120 --> 41:40.160
The scent on you
matches the smell of this garden.

41:40.840 --> 41:42.520
You pretended to be a thief
to extract information from me,

41:42.600 --> 41:44.080
set up an inescapable trap,

41:44.800 --> 41:45.720
and then caught me.

41:56.520 --> 41:57.880
I know I can't escape.

41:58.880 --> 42:03.840
But if I shout now,
my companions will inform all of Nanzhao

42:03.920 --> 42:07.920
that your Prince Bai
has secretly kept a Shu Red Brocade robe

42:08.560 --> 42:10.160
and not presented it to the Emperor.

42:10.680 --> 42:13.160
Is this mutually destructive outcome

42:14.080 --> 42:15.120
what you want?

42:37.000 --> 42:37.880
Yingying,

42:38.400 --> 42:39.680
thanks to you this time.

42:39.760 --> 42:40.600
Thank you.

42:41.600 --> 42:43.560
Auntie,
back when my family faced hardship,

42:43.640 --> 42:44.760
you helped us too.

42:44.840 --> 42:46.280
We're family. No need to mention it.
